# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# Every file under .github/ once showed up as fully rewritten in a diff because
# one machine saved them with CRLF. The content was identical; the diff was not,
# and a reviewer cannot see a real change inside a 2,000-line rewrite. Without
# this file that recurs on the next Windows checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts genuinely need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary — never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
